    <briefdescription>
<para>Implements a subscription to WAL updates via fs events. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Any change to the WAL dir itself or a change in the XLOG file triggers a wakeup. The WAL dir path is set in the constructor. XLOG file path is set with set_log_path(). </para>    </detaileddescription>
